{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b9f0a60c26346504edbea34d4f5fbeb70805ca1ca6c2b275cac215fb94dbd199", "ja": "待ち人を探して", "zh": "寻找意中人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0a85b3496c0462ad1adee170f0252a0eec10bf00d7ccffaffc73e0ddd3f724c0", "ja": "告白を決意したという女の子からの続報がな\nく、気がかりな様子の杏奈。自分は力になれ\nなかったのかも……？　仲間の励ましを受け\n一度は元気になる杏奈だったが、チアライブ\n後の人の中に、その子の姿を探してしまう。", "zh": "下定决心告白的那个女孩子一直没有传来后\n续消息，杏奈显得十分在意。难道自己没能\n帮上忙吗……？尽管在同伴的鼓励下杏奈一度\n重新振作了起来，但在啦啦队演出后的人群中\n，她还是不由自主地寻找起那个女孩子的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "03df16ec4d7d0732886f33da4a330518914e915c561a1d783ed13d801ac28000", "ja": "（みんなはチアダンスにもだいぶ慣れたみたいだ。\nただ、杏奈が集中できていないように見える……）", "zh": "（大家好像已经相当习惯啦啦队舞了。不过，看起来杏奈好像没法集中精神……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1b29e16d4e61aab396d89cda6691365f2b91b290fa4689dc9f3a3ec2098b304f", "ja": "うん、みんなすっごくいい感じだね。\nジャンプのタイミングもバッチリだよ！", "zh": "嗯，大家的状态都非常棒呢。\n起跳的时机也完全没问题哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "2f6ce23c1632d06cd0005cd76a795e4ede8cf111c6efbc10eca7ad843b307543", "ja": "ああ。ぶっ続けだったし、ここらで休憩かな。\nアンナも、ちょっと疲れてるみたいだし。", "zh": "是啊。一直连着练下来，也该在这里休息一下了。\n杏奈好像也有点累了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "cc86a2b65664a3d46b472966678c7b748013b22933c6b7d25ae9951343d3eef8", "ja": "そうだな。……杏奈、大丈夫か？", "zh": "是啊。……杏奈，你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "2545da9375b555cdec3c35d8c26bc3cdaa2ebcfdf52c5205548e1104eadeb4ea", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、どうかしたの？\nレッスン中も、元気がないみたいだったけど……。", "zh": "杏奈，怎么了？\n你在排练的时候好像也没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "54db212db5a0287849f5d87ccbfc618aa33d41d9cd64099877b75f08007b2b17", "ja": "杏奈、体調でも悪いのか？\nまだツアーは続くんだし、無理をしたらダメだぞ。", "zh": "杏奈，是不是身体不舒服？\n巡演还要继续，不能勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "2789de4c1e375890d1db231e2e5a28f056e04beb3ecb7291f45234a43b72c00c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nみんなも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n大家也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "44830e697ebc2409de830c5aafb24e94043b2b889f80cf16bdd81db88430b6b9", "ja": "杏奈は、大丈夫……元気、です。\nただ……。", "zh": "杏奈没事……很有精神。\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b7c0413397d5fa56076c0143963cdc6350700efc8d3a48725b21c3f1f94566f", "ja": "あれから……連絡、来ないなって……。\nいつも、メールくれてた……あの子……。", "zh": "从那以后……一直没收到联系呢……\n那个总是给我发邮件的孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "c2fbe4a8bcf5867a7a20277adb14f2fa99a0f0ad94b584bc8676b4a89bac34a7", "ja": "そういえば……しばらくメールが来てないね。\n告白するって言ったきり……。", "zh": "说起来……已经有一阵子没收到邮件了呢。\n自从说要告白之后，就再也没有消息了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "f02cfcc84eb0c7db2f3c48d9acfcf5b42585e70d68f42169549fafd6d5a35496", "ja": "もしかして、告白……。\nうまく、いかなかった……のかな。", "zh": "难道说，告白……  \n没能顺利成功……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "146c7ed8381ff54ba3afb55610701783360017410018585929863098d4d54fd8", "ja": "それは、わからないだろ。\nまだ告白してない可能性だってあるし。", "zh": "那还说不准吧。\n也有可能还没告白呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "6305a14a086b69253b636ddc341641e79f4f79b61a4edb92655c2a289b0daac6", "ja": "うん……。\n……。", "zh": "嗯……\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "1189b18501732481aa54c7e281e9da130f86c475f08508a62573fb050d47b4aa", "ja": "……杏奈ちゃん。とりあえず、\nもう少し待ってみても、いいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "……杏奈。总之，\n再稍微等一下看看，应该也是可以的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "f5231f6c6b06ad9e3fd512ddefd200adc985d1add3f738a71605020b8597e637", "ja": "他にも色んな理由が考えられるし……ね？\nとにかく、私達は最後まで見守ってあげよう！", "zh": "还可能有各种各样的原因……对吧？\n总之，我们就守护到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "f7290cfe66042e33a6130fb7e225a79f65cc3d7762fe82966516d6e6cba3cd55", "ja": "……ん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f1f0e93cfc1a864dfd5ecf037dd9069af78b58e389a77ddd9a57dc3c8039d553", "ja": "（杏奈、あのメールの子の事を気にしていたんだな。\nとはいえ、こちらから連絡を取る訳にもいかないしな）", "zh": "（原来杏奈一直在意那个发邮件的孩子啊。\n话虽如此，也不能由我们主动联系她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "55896651a9f590292c8bbc9816d121e0ba6e17a32448355f9259509e2b1df094", "ja": "（春香の言う通り……もう少しだけ、待ってみよう）", "zh": "（就像春香说的……再稍微等一等吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1019_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "dab1e46ce9294aaed4f36f0c54d47785f24ec3a39f72fce36df7aac652dc4a60", "ja": "ありがとうございました～！\nみなさん、今日も元気にいってらっしゃ～い！", "zh": "非常感谢大家～！\n大家今天也要精神饱满地出发哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "842c9e55e5e9932a9e694d32c5c4656278ae7fbc03e67b3046c9f43446c145ce", "ja": "（チアを見に来てくれる人は、増えてきた。\nみんなの応援が、多くの人に届いている証拠だな）", "zh": "（来看啦啦队表演的人越来越多了。这正是大家的加油声传达给更多人的证明啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "a276a34b930cfa51015fc662a184f466cc2ea11fa09b43d34f8babb4b67cd5b7", "ja": "今日も、けっこう立ち止まってたな。\nこの企画、成功って言っていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "今天也有不少人停下来呢。\n这个企划，可以说是成功了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "f0e2c1e20fcad1b0c8dec070d7c125a79b3e0aa7343e9cfe982b6c6801770b9b", "ja": "私達も成長してるからね！　今日の\nジュリアちゃん、すっごくキラキラしてたよ♪", "zh": "我们也在不断成长嘛！今天的茱莉亚，闪闪发光呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f292e7f7c964d4130a9df42c9757592e53d1663189a50f5060a1284c5c5af31", "ja": "き、キラキラか……。少し照れるけど、\nハルに褒められるのは、素直に嬉しいかな。", "zh": "闪、闪闪发光吗……虽然有点不好意思，\n但能被小春夸奖，我还是打心底里高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "7c35536fa2a7515e7518706d2e7b3df75c843b027cd075c6d1f3a6e46c9606dc", "ja": "いくらでも褒めちゃうよ！　今日もSNSに写真\nあがってると思うし、あとで一緒に見ようね♪", "zh": "想夸多少都可以哦！我想今天SNS上应该也上传了照片，待会儿一起看看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "1d80d604bdf195851a2944185255208a618c630f89ee9a5b7ecd03fa5962db01", "ja": "いや、SNSは見ない。心が乱れるからな……\nこのツアー中は封印するって決めたんだ。", "zh": "不，我不看社交平台。心绪会被打乱的……\n我已经决定，巡演期间要把它封印起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "03cf20a7efd69655c284bf3fa40cdfa6993fa3910b9b461904aa4013ab32da15", "ja": "でも、今日も可愛かったって書いてあったよ？\nウィンク失敗しちゃった後の照れた笑顔が最高とか……", "zh": "可是，今天也有人发帖说你很可爱哦？\n还说你眨眼失败后害羞的笑容最棒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "84b387b35a11a1b2afc475543847b7f752e55b162fb0c2eb69585709b11d9957", "ja": "そ、そういうのがあたしの心を乱すんだっての！\nもう、先に控え室戻ってるからな！", "zh": "就、就是说那些才会扰乱我的心啊！\n我先回休息室了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "6977980be592f95f9caa5ce047c5360d94e4ba758f918a7ca4d999c3ee56bc6b", "ja": "あっ、待って！\nジュリアちゃーん！", "zh": "啊，等等！\n茱莉亚——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "decfdad0b48ce6289de3c9e7204e8b3d8f23083a5d208493c431b6f5154e8042", "ja": "（春香だけでなくジュリアも、ダンスをしながら観客を\n見る余裕ができたみたいで、一安心だ。あとは……）", "zh": "（看来不仅是春香，茱莉亚也已经能一边跳舞一边从容地看向观众了，这下可以放心了。接下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3f8035d15f10c0c0de24959ce83f21f79453872ce3a579956122bf1ff594751", "ja": "……杏奈ちゃん。\n私たちも、控え室に戻ろっか！", "zh": "……杏奈。\n我们也回休息室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "d1efc1f2995496eabfa96511a8325fb4fdbb59b1082b9e77492d893458778393", "ja": "ん……もうちょっとだけ、待って……。", "zh": "嗯……再稍微等等……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "129b6293bd6d0fb0781fcee06d422c5f106a8c32776f044a8364c42bd019b65c", "ja": "……もしかして、あの子を探してるの？\nでもメールだけだから、顔もわからないし……。", "zh": "……难不成，你是在找那个孩子吗？\n可是你们只发过邮件，连长相都不知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b77e057ceac2f4a42efb22a2311148a57fe23449c7bd06f8425b6cf94ab9e33", "ja": "わかってる、けど……。気になって……。", "zh": "我知道，可是……就是有点在意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0233_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0233_story_04_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "7c48d5161343b651965ac25a0d5b1827e780e5c62271055fc1572206cba1d407", "ja": "……杏奈の、応援じゃ……ダメ、だったのかな……。", "zh": "……光靠杏奈的、支持……还是不行、吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
